OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuated tower residents 'in
OL,4,Alimbo' over costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents evacuated from three east
OL,7,FLondon tower blocks over structural
OL,8,Fsafety fears say they are "in limbo",
OL,9,Fnot knowing when they can return or who
OL,10,Fwill pay for somewhere to stay.
OL,12,FMore than 200 people living in
OL,13,FCenturion Tower, St Vincent Court and
OL,14,FSovereign Tower in Canning Town were
OL,15,Fordered to leave in the early hours of
OL,16,FFriday after engineers identified what
OL,17,Fthe buildings' managers called "an
OL,18,Fimminent risk to life".
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
