OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuated tower residents 'in
OL,4,Alimbo' over costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne resident said they had "not even an
OL,7,Fhour to get our passports and to
OL,8,Fleave", while another sad he was still
OL,9,Ftrying to work out what had happened.
OL,11,FArtem Semchik, from Centurion Tower,
OL,12,Fhas been sleeping on friends' sofas and
OL,13,Freturned to the building to collect
OL,14,Fessentials.
